// Seven equal bars on 1:2, the proportion of the designer's 2800 by 1400 pixel image.
// The middle bar is a gradient along the fly, from the edge color at both ends to the center color.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Traumagenic flag"
  designer "Selenelion Aberration"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  series "traumagenic-flag"
  version "normal"
  source "https://selenated.com/flags/traumagenic"
  source "https://cdn.selenated.com/img/f831.png"
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20251227023828/https://pluralpedia.org/w/Traumagenic"
  note "The designer's own flag page, on The Aberration's site selenated.com, read on 13 November 2026, defines traumagenic as a system that formed due to trauma, not exclusive to systems with DID or OSDD. It gives the meanings: gold, the pursuit of recovery and health; middle yellow, recognition of traumagenic systems without DID or OSDD; light yellow, acceptance of traumagenics in general; middle stripe, the diversity of the traumagenic experience and community; light blue, acceptance that we are more than what made us; middle blue, recognition of our systemmates as people; blue, the pursuit of cooperation between all members. Pluralpedia credits the flag to Selenelion Aberration. The page isn't dated, and no date is given."
  note "The page describes this 'normal' version as seven stripes, three shades of yellow darkening toward the top and three of blue darkening toward the bottom, with a middle stripe that is 'a center-meeting gradient of blue and yellow'. The colors are read from its image, 2800 by 1400 pixels with stripes of exactly 200: #ffdc64, #ffee83, #ffff9b, then the gradient, then #b2c2ff, #8a95ff and #6d68ff. The gradient changes only along the fly, from #d3d3fd at both edges to #f8f8c6 at the center, evenly, with slight dithering. The page gives no hex values."
  note "The page also has a simplified version, five stripes with white in the middle, which isn't encoded here."
}
palette {
  gold "#ffdc64"
  middle-yellow "#ffee83"
  light-yellow "#ffff9b"
  edge "#d3d3fd"
  center "#f8f8c6"
  light-blue "#b2c2ff"
  middle-blue "#8a95ff"
  blue "#6d68ff"
  middle gradient edge center edge
}
proportion hoist=1 fly=2

bars gold middle-yellow light-yellow middle light-blue middle-blue blue
